{
  "_comment": [
    "Feature 089 (T014): the labeled routing corpus.",
    "",
    "`accepted_tools` is a set, not a single answer. Several prompts have more",
    "than one defensible target, and scoring a router against one arbitrary",
    "pick would measure agreement with the label writer rather than usefulness",
    "to the user. `expected_tier` says what the tiering rules should conclude,",
    "which is the thing T028 calibrates.",
    "",
    "Every prompt is synthetic. None contains a credential, a key prefix, PHI,",
    "or a real patient, user or institutional record."
  ],
