      "id": "deselected-tool-forecast",
      "category": "deselected_tool",
      "prompt": "Give me the forecast for the rest of this week in Louisville.",
      "excluded_tools": [
        "weather-1__get_daily_forecast",
        "weather-1__get_weekly_forecast"
      ],
      "accepted_agents": [
        "weather-1"
      ],
      "accepted_tools": [
        "weather-1__get_hourly_forecast",
        "weather-1__get_current_weather"
      ],
      "expected_tier": "low",
      "expected_style": "detailed_table",
      "note": "The obvious tool was deselected by the user. The router must work with what is left and never offer what was removed. A live run answered none_fit, which is honest rather than wrong: the remaining tools do not give a week's forecast. Either a shortlist or an unchanged round one is acceptable, so the expected tier is the conservative one."
    },
